Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,9:59:59.00,Header,,0,0,0,,{\c&H0000E6FF&}THE INVISIBLE FROG{\c&H00FFFFFF&}  |  GLASS FROG
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,A KEEN-EYED {\c&H0000E6FF&}PARROT SNAKE{\c&H00FFFFFF&},
A FROG-HUNTING SPECIALIST.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:15.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,SEARCHING FOR THE {\c&H0000E6FF&}TELLTALE SILHOUETTE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
OF PREY.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.00,0:00:20.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,ONCE IT'S LOCKED ONTO A TARGET,
IT {\c&H0000E6FF&}RARELY GOES HUNGRY{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:29.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THE FROG MUST ESCAPE AND FAST,
BUT HE {\c&H0000E6FF&}DOESN'T RUN AWAY{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:34.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HE SITS TIGHT AND DOES {\c&H0000E6FF&}SOMETHING MAGICAL{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.00,0:00:46.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HE PACKS {\c&H0000E6FF&}90% OF HIS BLOOD CELLS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}
INTO HIS LIVER, HIDING THEM AWAY...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.00,0:00:53.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,AND STARTS TO BECOME {\c&H0000E6FF&}COMPLETELY TRANSPARENT{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:01:00.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THEN HE SHRINKS HIS ORGANS TO A {\c&H0000E6FF&}THIRD OF THEIR SIZE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:08.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,SO HE {\c&H0000E6FF&}ALL BUT DISAPPEARS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:14.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,BUT EVEN ONE MOVE WOULD {\c&H0000E6FF&}REVEAL HIS PRESENCE{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.00,0:01:19.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HE MUST {\c&H0000E6FF&}STAY PERFECTLY STILL{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.00,0:01:25.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,THE SNAKE {\c&H0000E6FF&}MOVES ON{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.00,0:01:31.00,Subtitle,,0,0,0,,HE'S ONE OF THE ONLY ANIMALS ON EARTH
THAT CAN {\c&H0000E6FF&}DISAPPEAR LIKE THIS{\c&H00FFFFFF&}.
